{"label_alt_en":["Draft scheme of the Committee : organisation: Art. 27","organisation: Art. 27"],"label_alt_fr":["Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction : organisation: Art. 27","organisation: Art. 27"],"broader":[{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null}],"id":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-27","issues":[],"pages":[588,612],"pref_en":"Draft scheme: organisation, article 27","pref_fr":"Avant-projet : organisation, article 27","printed":["t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.organisation-art-27"],"related":[],"label_scope_note_en":"The Committee considered article 27 of the organisation section of the draft scheme.","type":"concept","direct_count":3,"propagated_count":3,"breadcrumb_paths":[[{"id":"facet.committee","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Travaux du Comité","pref_en":"The Committee's own work","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-27","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet : organisation, article 27","pref_en":"Draft scheme: organisation, article 27","is_facet":null}],[{"id":"facet.nature","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Nature et établissement de la Cour","pref_en":"Nature & establishment of the Court","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-27","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet : organisation, article 27","pref_en":"Draft scheme: organisation, article 27","is_facet":null}]],"narrower":[],"printed_entries":[{"entries":[{"article_ref":{"art":"27","part":"organisation","range":null},"label_heading":"Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction","id":"fr.0027.23","lang":"fr","qualifier":null,"raw":"Art. 27 — 578 seq., 602.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":["seq"],"pdf":588,"printed":578,"raw":"578 seq","seq":true},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":612,"printed":602,"raw":"602","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":776,"sub":"organisation: Art. 27"},{"article_ref":{"art":"27","part":"organisation","range":null},"label_heading":"Draft scheme of the Committee","id":"en.0075.23","lang":"en","qualifier":null,"raw":"Art. 27 — 578 seq., 602.","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":["seq"],"pdf":588,"printed":578,"raw":"578 seq","seq":true},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":612,"printed":602,"raw":"602","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":783,"sub":"organisation: Art. 27"}],"id":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.organisation-art-27","label_en":"organisation: Art. 27","label_fr":"organisation: Art. 27","n_pages":2,"pages":[588,612],"parent":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction","printed_en_id":"en.0075.23","printed_fr_id":"fr.0027.23","see":[],"type":"article"}],"groups":[{"meeting":27,"section":"27","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0589.08","meeting":27,"doc":"minutes","pdf":589,"printed":579,"texts":{"fr":"…veur de ses ressortissants ou des ressortissants d'un protectorat ou même d'un autre Etat à la protection duquel il est habilité par traité.\" Comme suite à la discussion de cette formule, le Président propose ce texte: „La Cour connaît de litiges entre Etats. Nulle réclamation d'un particulier contre un Etat étranger ne peut venir devant la Cour à moins qu'un Etat ne prenne fait et cause pour ses nationaux ou pour d'autres personnes dont la protection lui appartient en droit.\" Le Président soulève la question d'un locus standi spécial pour la Société des Nations et ses organes. Il propose ensuite une formule aux…","en":"\"The Court shall only have jurisdiction to hear and determine suits between States. A State may, however, bring before the Court a suit which it has taken up on behalf of its subjects or of the subjects of a Protectorate or even of the subjects of another State, which it has been empowered to…","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0589.08","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-27","weight":1.0,"end":260,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4663,"start":221}]},{"seg_id":"s0590.01","meeting":27,"doc":"minutes","pdf":590,"printed":580,"texts":{"fr":"LORD PHILLIMORE propose de procéder par énumération. L'accord ne s'établissant pas, le Comité décide, par un vote formel, de ne point compléter l'article 27, alinéa 1.","en":"LORD PHILLIMORE proposed that the method of enumeration should be used. As no agreement could be reached, the Committee, by a formal vote, decided not to add anything to Article 27, Para. 1.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0590.01","speaker_id":"phillimore","certain":true,"name":"Lord Phillimore","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-27","weight":1.0,"end":166,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4670,"start":122}]},{"seg_id":"s0590.03","meeting":27,"doc":"minutes","pdf":590,"printed":580,"texts":{"fr":"M. ALTAMIRA vote contre, le texte ainsi réduit ne donnant pas assez de garanties que les Etats appuyeront impartialement les réclamations des particuliers.","en":"M. ALTAMIRA voted against this Article, as the text, thus reduced, did not afford a sufficient guarantee that States would impartially support claims of private individuals.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0590.03","speaker_id":"altamira","certain":true,"name":"Rafael Altamira","role":"member"},"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.draft-scheme-organisation-article-27","weight":1.0,"end":80,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4671,"start":25}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"c